.TH PRINCETHEME 1 "Jan 2026" "1.0.0" "PrinceTheme Manual"

.SH NAME
princetheme \- Enterprise Grade GRUB Theme Manager

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B princetheme
.RI [ command ] [ options ]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B PrinceTheme
is a comprehensive suite for managing GRUB2 bootloader themes. It includes a Python SDK, a TUI Store, and over 100 variants.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B check
Validate all theme files in the variants directory.
.TP
.B build
Generate theme variants from the internal palette engine.
.TP
.B gallery
Generate an HTML gallery of all available themes.

.SH SCRIPTS
.TP
.B switch_theme.sh
Interactive TUI to switch between variants.
.TP
.B switch_font.sh
Interactive TUI to switch fonts.
.TP
.B theme_store.sh
The full visual store experience.

.SH FILES
.TP
.I /boot/grub/themes/PrinceTheme/theme.txt
The active configuration file.

.SH AUTHOR
PrinceTheProgrammer
